    "created_at": "2021-09-16T19:15:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-09-16T19:16:48Z",
    "body": "This behaviour is intentional. You can prevent this by modifying the module format strings (`starship print-config` might be helpful if you wish to replace all the module format strings). For example, you could replace `\"via [$symbol($version )]($style)\"` with `'(via [$symbol$version ]($style))'` to ensure it's only shown when `$version` has a value and the relevant binaries are installed.\r\n\r\nA preset with format string might be a good addition for the preset page, though.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
