    "created_at": "2022-10-22T11:19:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-10-22T11:20:12Z",
    "body": "The title and OP of this ticket talks about Starship behavior.\r\n\r\nWhen @davidkna added the documentation label, they talked about adding a configuration preset.\r\n\r\n#3248 discusses Starship behavior.\r\n\r\nAm I right to assume then that this ticket is about adding a preset for hiding module format on missing toolsets - despite the ticket title and post being about something different?",
